TI  - Soil environment is a key driver of adaptation in Medicago truncatula: new insights from landscape genomics
PY  - 2018
T2  - New Phytologist
VL  - 219
IS  - 1
SP  - 378
EP  - 390
DO  - 10.1111/nph.15171
