TI  - Fine-scale population epigenetic structure in relation to gastrointestinal parasite load in red grouse (Lagopus lagopus scotica)
PY  - 2014
T2  - Molecular Ecology
VL  - 23
IS  - 17
SP  - 4256
EP  - 4273
DO  - 10.1111/mec.12833
