TI  - Comparative analysis of cold-responsive genes under short-term cold stimulation and cold-adaptive genes under long-term heterogeneous environments reveals a cold adaptation mechanism in weeping forsythia
PY  - 2023
T2  - Genetica
VL  - 151
IS  - 1
SP  - 47
