TI  - Selection despite low genetic diversity and high gene flow in a rapid island invasion of the bumblebee, Bombus terrestris
PY  - 2024
T2  - Molecular Ecology
VL  - 33
IS  - 2
C7  - e17212
DO  - 10.1111/mec.17212
