TI  - Contrasting patterns of local adaptation along climatic gradients between a sympatric parasitic and autotrophic tree species
PY  - 2020
T2  - Molecular Ecology
VL  - 29
IS  - 16
SP  - 3022
EP  - 3037
DO  - 10.1111/mec.15537
