TI  - Integration of disease-specific single nucleotide polymorphisms, Expression quantitative trait loci and coexpression networks reveal novel candidate genes for type 2 diabetes
PY  - 2012
T2  - Diabetologia
VL  - 55
IS  - 8
SP  - 2205
